Cell["\<\
Take Conjugate \[Zeta]0 as \[OpenCurlyQuote]Hole\[CloseCurlyQuote] in or \
\[OpenCurlyQuote]Shadow on the NULL Plane by existence of \[Zeta]0
Genitive value reflecting lack of: \[Zeta]0 + Conjugate[\[Zeta]0] must sum to \
NULL 
Core of symmetry 
Mathematically a Reflection thus a Rotation.
\
\>", "Text",
